# "When this creature dies, you gain 2 life" (CR 603.10a, 700.4): Bot2's Lightning Bolt kills the 4/2 Longneck, and its controller Bot1,
# not Bot2, gains exactly 2: 20 to 22, with Bot2 still at 20. Life is checked before the Bolt so the gain is the trigger's, not
# something earlier.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Grasping Longneck
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Hand.Grasping Longneck.Cast
? Bot1.Life = 20
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Grasping Longneck)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 22
Bot2.Life = 20
Bot1.Graveyard = Grasping Longneck; Black Lotus
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 0
Stack.Count = 0
